Parent: 1522

## Context
Child of tracker 1522; same transport (local API, author ruling 2026-11-11)
and the same tag key as 1525, so a pull right after a publish reads what was
published.

## Design (MOE)
- Verb `pull-notes`: the child notes of a project (by tag `wiki:<project>/*`)
  -> one HTML snapshot per note plus its metadata (item key, slug, version,
  date modified) on stdout or into a directory the caller names. The `.qmd`
  envelope belongs to the consumer (climate-finance-het 3019 wraps it); the
  harness emits HTML and metadata only.
- Unavailable is reported as such, never as an empty project.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] zotero pull-notes verb with tests on the live fixture (round trip with
      publish-notes; unavailable != empty)
- [ ] skills/zotero/SKILL.md documents the verb
